{"4887630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KEYKRUNCHER™", "steam_appid": 4887630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4921860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/067f5ed024fcf1528644773ba9aa2e67.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.poster.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.webm?t=1787365234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.mp4?t=1787365234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYKRUNCHER™ is the ultimate treatment for your insatiable desire to consume keyboards!</strong> <br>You have been placed in an assessment room with a scrambled keyboard, a gumball machine, and IT waiting at the end of the hallway.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KLICK</strong> the <strong>KEYS</strong> to <strong>KRUNCH</strong> them, earn tokens to pull new keycaps, and solve each <strong>lesson</strong> before <strong>IT</strong> solves you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/babb07d0adba032f87d56efaecf7ffc9.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round presents a freshly scrambled keyboard. Feel the satisfaction of watching keys disappear as you chomp them into pieces. <strong>The more you eat, the closer you get to solving your problems for good.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYKRUNCHER™ features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Professional keyboard training</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human interface device consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrambled keyboards every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL</strong> keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gumball machine full of new <i>&quot;training&quot;</i> materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANDATORY INSTRUCTIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long hallway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">IT is in the hallway</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continued learning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revelation</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/eca33d8ccb8ef0dfd8d41ab06f28c351.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1228 height=242 /></span>Many keyboards were harmed in the development of <strong>KEYKRUNCHER™</strong>.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/067f5ed024fcf1528644773ba9aa2e67.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.poster.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.webm?t=1787365234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/2fad7788c973102189107c5264641e59.mp4?t=1787365234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYKRUNCHER™ is the ultimate treatment for your insatiable desire to consume keyboards!</strong> <br>You have been placed in an assessment room with a scrambled keyboard, a gumball machine, and IT waiting at the end of the hallway.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KLICK</strong> the <strong>KEYS</strong> to <strong>KRUNCH</strong> them, earn tokens to pull new keycaps, and solve each <strong>lesson</strong> before <strong>IT</strong> solves you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887630/extras/babb07d0adba032f87d56efaecf7ffc9.avif?t=1787365234\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round presents a freshly scrambled keyboard. Feel the satisfaction of watching keys disappear as you chomp them into pieces. <strong>The more you eat, the closer you get to solving your problems for good.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYKRUNCHER™ features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Professional keyboard training</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human interface device consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrambled keyboards every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL</strong> keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gumball machine full of new <i>&quot;training&quot;</i> materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANDATORY INSTRUCTIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long hallway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">IT is in the hallway</span><